          "en": "Thor ran to Loki, the cleverest of the gods, and told him everything."
        },
        {
          "es": "Juntos le pidieron a Freyja que les prestara su capa de plumas de halcón.",
          "en": "Together they asked Freyja to lend her cloak of falcon feathers."
        },
        {
          "es": "Freyja la prestaría aunque fuera de oro. Loki se la puso y voló al norte, a Jötunheim.",
