          1.08
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "De vuelta en Asgard, Loki le dijo a Freyja: ponte el velo de novia, vamos a Jötunheim.",
          "en": "Back in Asgard, Loki told Freyja: put on your bridal veil, we are going to Jotunheim."
        },
        {
          "es": "Freyja se puso tan furiosa que los salones temblaron, y su gran collar, Brísingamen, estalló.",
          "en": "Freyja was so furious that the halls shook, and her great necklace, Brisingamen, burst apart."
        },
        {
          "es": "Jamás me casaré con un gigante, dijo, ni por todos los martillos del mundo.",
          "en": "I will never marry a giant, she said, not for all the hammers in the world."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces Heimdall, que ve el futuro, tuvo una idea increíble: vistamos a Thor de novia.",
          "en": "Then Heimdall, who sees the future, had a wild idea: dress Thor as the bride."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un velo, llaves y Brísingamen en el pecho. Thor protestó, pero Loki dijo: sin martillo, no hay Asgard.",
          "en": "A veil, keys, and Brisingamen on his chest. Thor protested, but Loki said: no hammer, no Asgard."
        },
        {
          "es": "Yo iré contigo como tu dama de compañía.",
          "en": "I will go with you as your maid."
        }
      ],
