      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pero Thor no siempre ganaba. Un día partió a Jötunheim con Loki y el veloz Thjalfi.",
          "en": "But Thor did not always win. One day he set out for Jotunheim with Loki and swift Thjalfi."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al caer la noche encontraron en el bosque un refugio enorme, de entrada inmensa.",
          "en": "At nightfall they found a huge shelter in the forest, with a vast entrance."
        },
        {
          "es": "En la oscuridad la tierra tembló con un rugido, y se escondieron en una cámara lateral.",
          "en": "In the dark the ground shook with a roar, and they hid in a small side chamber."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al amanecer vieron a un gigante roncando: era Skrymir, y el refugio era su guante.",
          "en": "At dawn they found a giant snoring: it was Skrymir, and the shelter was his glove."
